# Query Language: Patterns

Spec: QueryPatterns
Purpose:
  Document common query patterns used by AI and human users
  when navigating the engineering knowledge graph.

Owns: queries/patterns.sdd

CommonPatterns:

  "Show me all architecture decisions for payment"
    → @domain:payment shows decisions

  "Why does this code exist?"
    → CODE → TASK → DECISION → ARCHITECTURE → PRINCIPLE → REFERENCE

  "What will break if I change idempotency?"
    → @impact:@concept.idempotency
    → shows affected skills, tasks, decisions, docs, tests

  "Which skills have no proof?"
    → @skill where proof=none

  "Find duplicated concepts"
    → find concepts with >90% semantic overlap

  "Show unknowns blocking this task"
    → @unknown:blocking @task.T2041

  "Show architecture drift"
    → compare @decision.D88 (says DDD) vs actual code structure

  "What alternatives were considered for this decision?"
    → @decision.D88 → REJECTED → alternatives + reasons

PatternLibrary:
  Archaeology:  CODE → TASK → DECISION → ARCHITECTURE → PRINCIPLE → REFERENCE
  ImpactAnalysis: CONCEPT → [USES] → SKILLS → TASKS → DECISIONS → DOCS → TESTS
  UnknownTracking: UNKNOWN → RESEARCH_TASK → DECISION
  EvolutionTrace: OLD_KNOWLEDGE → CHALLENGE → NEW_DECISION → PROMOTION
  FailureAnalysis: FAILURE → ROOT_CAUSE → KNOWLEDGE_UPDATE → SKILL_UPDATE

State: +
